WEBVTT

00:00:22.164 --> 00:00:23.933
In the warring states of old,

00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:27.403
Shinobi worked behind the scenes
to change the tides of battle...

00:00:27.403 --> 00:00:29.572
And even now, when peace reigns,

00:00:29.572 --> 00:00:33.668
they continue to work covertly for
the sake of country, for the sake of people.

00:00:37.346 --> 00:00:38.514
And...

00:00:38.514 --> 00:00:40.916
in the Village Hidden in the Leaves
in the Land of Fire...

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:42.852
are young Shinobi apprentices...

00:00:42.852 --> 00:00:45.286
who dream of becoming
the heroes of tomorrow.

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:50.726
One such youth is Naruto Uzumaki

00:00:50.726 --> 00:00:54.992
who dreams of becoming a Hokage
and is currently training diIigentIy.

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:04.864
Hot...

00:01:05.975 --> 00:01:07.374
Hot... It's hot.

00:01:07.443 --> 00:01:08.910
Be quiet, Naruto!

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:12.975
We just got our summer uniforms!
What’s the point if you complain?

00:01:13.182 --> 00:01:14.206
Let’s hang in there!

00:01:14.416 --> 00:01:16.316
We’re almost at
the rendezvous point.

00:01:17.286 --> 00:01:19.277
A B-rank mission, huh?

00:01:19.622 --> 00:01:22.750
This client is a big VIP, right?

00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:25.385
That’s what Lady Tsunade said.

00:01:45.481 --> 00:01:47.108
What are they?

00:01:51.186 --> 00:01:55.486
This is from all my shopping!

00:01:56.959 --> 00:02:00.195
There were so many things that
I liked during my travels...

00:02:00.195 --> 00:02:02.686
and I ended up with this much
before I knew it.

00:02:07.303 --> 00:02:10.761
I am the prince of the Land of Moon,
Michiru Tsuki.

00:02:11.473 --> 00:02:12.531
You must be...

00:02:12.641 --> 00:02:14.541
We have come from
the Village Hidden in the Leaves.

00:02:15.144 --> 00:02:17.669
I am the squad leader,
Kakashi Hatake.

00:02:18.514 --> 00:02:20.175
He’s Naruto Uzumaki.

00:02:20.449 --> 00:02:21.416
What’s up?!

00:02:21.817 --> 00:02:22.841
Sakura Haruno.

00:02:23.352 --> 00:02:24.250
Hello!

00:02:24.486 --> 00:02:25.680
And Rock Lee.

00:02:25.754 --> 00:02:26.516
Sir!

00:02:27.089 --> 00:02:31.150
The four of us will guard Your Highness
until you reach your homeland.

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:34.729
I see. I’m counting on you.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:38.728
Huh?

00:02:38.867 --> 00:02:43.964
You’re very cute.
Such a cute girl is a Ninja?

00:02:44.473 --> 00:02:46.202
She’s young, but extremely capable.

00:02:47.743 --> 00:02:48.971
Is that so?

00:02:49.778 --> 00:02:51.609
Much obliged, young lady.

00:02:52.281 --> 00:02:53.612
Thank you.

00:03:07.229 --> 00:03:09.356
Her grip is stronger than most adults, too.

00:03:10.065 --> 00:03:11.157
l-l see.

00:03:15.004 --> 00:03:17.598
W-What?! The enemy?!

00:03:18.874 --> 00:03:20.501
That one would’ve killed you.

00:03:20.909 --> 00:03:21.603
Huh?

00:03:23.012 --> 00:03:25.742
Are you sure about these folks, Papa?

00:03:25.814 --> 00:03:27.543
Won’t they be useless?

00:03:28.317 --> 00:03:29.716
Especially that one over there.

00:03:29.818 --> 00:03:31.752
W-What did you say, you bra—?!

00:03:33.555 --> 00:03:35.819
This is my son, Hikaru.

00:03:36.158 --> 00:03:37.726
He’s just in that mischievous stage.

00:03:37.726 --> 00:03:38.954
Will you overlook it?

00:03:39.695 --> 00:03:41.253
Nice to meet you, Hikaru.

00:03:43.132 --> 00:03:43.928
Humph!

00:03:43.966 --> 00:03:45.991
What do you mean “humph”?!

00:03:46.702 --> 00:03:48.226
Let’s be on our way.

00:03:50.806 --> 00:03:53.934
Put up with it.
Remember what Lady Tsunade said?

00:03:54.743 --> 00:03:56.979
If anything should happen
to the prince,

00:03:56.979 --> 00:03:58.913
it’ll become an international incident.

00:04:04.553 --> 00:04:14.224
NARUTO THE MOVIE
GUARD/ANS OF
THE CRESCENT MOON KINGDOM

00:04:20.803 --> 00:04:22.237
The Land of Moon...

00:04:22.237 --> 00:04:26.697
In the distant southern seas,
lies the tropical Crescent Island.

00:04:27.476 --> 00:04:30.036
The Land of Moon is situated there,
and apparently very prosperous.

00:04:31.146 --> 00:04:32.948
lt’s rich in natural resources,

00:04:32.948 --> 00:04:35.974
and the lure of their tourist trade
is the beautiful coral beaches.

00:04:37.152 --> 00:04:40.952
The government-run casinos
are popular and bustling year round.

00:04:41.623 --> 00:04:43.523
I’d love to go there at least once.

00:04:43.592 --> 00:04:45.082
You like gambling, after all.

00:05:15.757 --> 00:05:16.689
Oww!

00:05:20.429 --> 00:05:21.862
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

00:05:45.454 --> 00:05:48.257
Your mission is to protect the prince
of this nation and his son

00:05:48.257 --> 00:05:51.920
who have been visiting various countries
until they reach home.

00:05:53.162 --> 00:05:55.164
Apparently, the previous bodyguards

00:05:55.164 --> 00:05:57.894
ran off due to
the harshness of the mission.

00:05:58.367 --> 00:05:59.595
Looks like quite a mission.

00:05:59.635 --> 00:06:03.162
Well, I’ve called in Rock Lee
to assist this time.

00:06:03.639 --> 00:06:04.936
So get along with each other!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:05.529
Right!

00:06:06.108 --> 00:06:08.838
In any case,
this is an important mission.

00:06:09.344 --> 00:06:12.609
Normally, l’d assign this to
Jonin-level Ninja.

00:06:13.315 --> 00:06:14.714
Be alert and do your best!

00:06:14.917 --> 00:06:15.815
— Right!
— Right!

00:06:40.342 --> 00:06:41.476
By the way, Prince...

00:06:41.476 --> 00:06:44.639
Do you intend to take over
eventually as King?

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:47.642
Of course, after my papa retires.

00:06:48.217 --> 00:06:50.981
But he’s still very ﬁt,
so it won’t happen anytime soon.

00:06:51.253 --> 00:06:52.354
Why, even this journey

00:06:52.354 --> 00:06:54.289
— was forced onto me by him...
— Hey, what game is that?

00:06:54.289 --> 00:06:56.757
to broaden my horizons.

00:06:57.025 --> 00:06:58.322
Is it fun?

00:06:58.493 --> 00:07:01.519
Tell me, what kind of man is
the king of Hidden Leaf Village?

00:07:01.597 --> 00:07:03.232
We don’t use “King,“

00:07:03.232 --> 00:07:05.968
— No way I can become friends with one.
— but our Hokage is ﬁne indeed...

00:07:05.968 --> 00:07:08.163
with outstanding abilities as a Shinobi.

00:07:09.104 --> 00:07:12.096
Is this Hokage title passed down
through generations?

00:07:12.341 --> 00:07:15.110
No. In our homeland,
one with strong convictions

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:18.409
and the ability to maintain harmony
is chosen as Hokage.

00:07:19.348 --> 00:07:21.049
Take this lad, for example...

00:07:21.049 --> 00:07:23.950
Naruto’s dream is
to become Hokage some day.

00:07:24.753 --> 00:07:27.055
In order to realize that dream,

00:07:27.055 --> 00:07:29.717
he will persevere endlessly
and face every adversity.

00:07:29.891 --> 00:07:32.325
Hmm... How impressive!

00:07:32.394 --> 00:07:36.888
Nah! If I consider it part of training,
it’s not bad at all.

00:07:37.799 --> 00:07:38.731
How stupid.

00:07:38.834 --> 00:07:39.562
Huh?

00:07:42.771 --> 00:07:43.805
Hey...

00:07:43.805 --> 00:07:46.603
What was that for?
What did you mean?

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:50.535
Hey! I’m speaking to you—!

00:07:53.315 --> 00:07:54.680
Now, calm down.

00:08:09.765 --> 00:08:11.858
The Great Animal Circus
Now Performing In Town!

00:08:58.447 --> 00:09:01.450
And now, what you’ve been
waiting for!

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:05.216
It’s time for the rare saber-tooth tiger!

00:09:26.308 --> 00:09:30.142
Behold! Chamu,
the saber-tooth tiger!

00:09:32.114 --> 00:09:35.413
And Chamu’s partner, Kikki!

00:09:42.657 --> 00:09:46.491
And now, please enjoy
their special performance!

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:24.758
Next, it becomes much
more difﬁcult!

00:10:27.803 --> 00:10:30.829
If he misses, Kikki will be
in great danger!

00:10:31.139 --> 00:10:33.733
Now, will he succeed?

00:10:52.027 --> 00:10:53.016
Easy.

00:10:53.829 --> 00:10:56.059
Oh, what an amazing young lad!

00:10:59.234 --> 00:11:01.930
However, what about this? There!

00:11:06.141 --> 00:11:07.768
Well, young lad?

00:11:08.176 --> 00:11:11.236
If you make this shot,
you shall be rewarded!

00:11:33.301 --> 00:11:36.668
That was great, Hikaru!

00:11:42.811 --> 00:11:44.836
That boy is quite good.

00:11:47.749 --> 00:11:50.274
You’re great, laddie.
That’s some talent!

00:11:51.052 --> 00:11:52.417
It’s nothing.

00:11:53.221 --> 00:11:58.090
I must reward you. Let’s see...
What can I give you?

00:11:58.193 --> 00:11:59.127
That over there.

00:11:59.127 --> 00:11:59.821
Huh?

00:12:01.029 --> 00:12:04.692
Oh, that one’s too big and dangerous!

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:08.269
Besides, it’s essential for business.

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.260
No, I want it.

00:12:10.672 --> 00:12:12.697
— Even if you say so...
— It’s okay, isn’t it, Papa?

00:12:13.408 --> 00:12:14.500
I guess so.

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:20.212
I like this circus, so what the heck,
I’ll take the entire circus!

00:12:20.448 --> 00:12:21.312
Huh?!

00:12:24.252 --> 00:12:25.620
Oh no! Nishikawa fainted...

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.722
— Can the cash wait 'til we get to the island?
— because the amount was so huge!

00:12:27.722 --> 00:12:29.190
We've no choice but to call...

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:30.384
— Yes.
— Aruaru's Expedition Team!

00:12:41.069 --> 00:12:43.537
He really bought the entire circus.

00:12:43.772 --> 00:12:44.864
Is he for real?!

00:12:53.848 --> 00:12:55.315
Oh, but of course...

00:12:55.517 --> 00:12:57.652
I couldn’t have asked for
a greater opportunity

00:12:57.652 --> 00:12:59.449
than to perform in
the Land of Moon.

00:12:59.654 --> 00:13:02.623
We will do our utmost!

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:09.721
Here.

00:13:16.237 --> 00:13:17.363
Oh laddie!

00:13:25.914 --> 00:13:27.313
That was a close call!

00:13:27.616 --> 00:13:30.852
Laddie, Chamu can’t get used
to humans.

00:13:30.852 --> 00:13:32.444
He’s even aggressive towards me,
after all this time...

00:13:32.487 --> 00:13:35.615
Do something about him!
He’s dangerous!

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:38.827
O-Of course! I will lock him up
in the cage

00:13:38.827 --> 00:13:40.852
and keep him under strict watch.

00:13:42.464 --> 00:13:44.091
Yo! Got scared, huh?

00:13:50.639 --> 00:13:51.435
Hey...

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.366
Oh say...!

00:13:56.111 --> 00:13:58.341
At least say thanks!

00:14:18.466 --> 00:14:21.236
It seems to be due to the storms,

00:14:21.236 --> 00:14:24.105
but the regular ships due to
make stops on Crescent Island

00:14:24.105 --> 00:14:25.834
haven’t arrived for two days.

00:14:26.107 --> 00:14:30.476
And so, I have made immediate
arrangements for provisional ships.

00:14:31.413 --> 00:14:34.541
Well, I have some important business
to tend to, so that’s fine.

00:14:34.716 --> 00:14:36.411
But do hurry.

00:14:41.423 --> 00:14:42.788
— Papa?
— Hmm?

00:14:43.258 --> 00:14:44.418
Where are you going?

00:14:44.926 --> 00:14:46.689
To your mother's place.

00:14:48.129 --> 00:14:48.788
Huh?

00:15:13.254 --> 00:15:15.552
It’s been a long time, Amayo.

00:15:17.225 --> 00:15:18.089
Oh!

00:15:21.696 --> 00:15:23.493
Oh, my honey!

00:15:25.667 --> 00:15:27.532
Hikaru? You’re Hikaru?

00:15:29.704 --> 00:15:31.331
Oh, Hikaru!

00:15:34.042 --> 00:15:34.838
Hikaru!

00:15:35.877 --> 00:15:39.074
Huh? Is that the guy’s wife?

00:15:43.251 --> 00:15:45.583
How you’ve grown! Hikaru!

00:15:50.058 --> 00:15:51.025
Who are you?

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:55.793
How cold of you, Amayo!
It’s me! Me!

00:15:57.699 --> 00:15:59.860
It can’t be... Michiru?

00:16:00.168 --> 00:16:01.328
Yes.

00:16:01.536 --> 00:16:04.096
No way! You’re a different person!

00:16:04.372 --> 00:16:05.703
You’re so fat!

00:16:06.274 --> 00:16:08.572
It’s your fault for going away!

00:16:08.743 --> 00:16:11.513
I ate to stiﬂe my loneliness...

00:16:11.513 --> 00:16:13.640
and this is what happened.

00:16:17.819 --> 00:16:20.481
So I want you to come back to me.

00:16:20.622 --> 00:16:22.783
I’m lonely, and so is Hikaru...

00:16:22.957 --> 00:16:26.484
I told you, I don’t want to be
with you anymore.

00:16:26.895 --> 00:16:29.597
And if we didn’t have
a pre-nuptial agreement,

00:16:29.597 --> 00:16:32.327
I would have raised Hikaru myself!

00:16:33.001 --> 00:16:35.765
Why do you hate me so much?

00:16:36.137 --> 00:16:38.537
I gave you everything
you wanted, didn’t I?

00:16:38.873 --> 00:16:40.465
Wasn’t it enough?

00:16:40.742 --> 00:16:43.233
No... l lacked the most important thing.

00:16:43.678 --> 00:16:44.576
Huh?

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:48.308
Hmm? I know! A ﬁne mansion!

00:16:48.483 --> 00:16:49.415
No!

00:16:52.554 --> 00:16:55.148
Well then, how about
a summer villa?

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:57.950
You can have your parents
live with us.

00:17:09.904 --> 00:17:14.034
Don’t be so mean.
Let’s live...together again.

00:17:14.642 --> 00:17:16.542
Just tell me what you want.

00:17:16.744 --> 00:17:19.713
Jewels, treasures...

00:17:20.048 --> 00:17:23.108
Why I’d even give you
the Land of Moon...

00:17:24.419 --> 00:17:25.283
Oh!

00:17:30.058 --> 00:17:31.719
You haven’t changed at all.

00:17:32.627 --> 00:17:37.087
You really don’t know
what’s truly precious.

00:18:00.655 --> 00:18:02.987
Oh, I wonder why...

00:18:03.224 --> 00:18:05.089
I just don’t understand.

00:18:07.629 --> 00:18:10.894
Lord Michiru, I must consult you
about the ship’s departure.

00:18:11.466 --> 00:18:12.364
Hmm...?

00:18:16.938 --> 00:18:18.166
All right.

00:18:21.976 --> 00:18:26.811
It’s impossible to load everything
on the ship, after all. And so...

00:18:34.589 --> 00:18:36.056
I see.

00:18:36.591 --> 00:18:38.320
That’s the boy’s mother...

00:18:38.693 --> 00:18:42.925
She got sick and tired of the guy
and left him three years ago.

00:18:43.464 --> 00:18:44.954
I can understand why she did.

00:18:55.777 --> 00:18:57.972
I’m going to check on the boat.

00:18:58.913 --> 00:18:59.902
Uh-huh.

00:19:17.532 --> 00:19:19.227
Does that taste good?

00:19:19.734 --> 00:19:20.723
Huh?

00:19:22.503 --> 00:19:24.372
Yeah, it’s yummy.

00:19:24.372 --> 00:19:27.136
But it’s probably not
something you’d like.

00:19:36.551 --> 00:19:37.916
Be my vassal.

00:19:38.653 --> 00:19:39.415
Huh?

00:19:39.988 --> 00:19:43.185
If you serve me,
I’ll give you anything you want.

00:19:43.992 --> 00:19:45.050
No thanks.

00:19:46.461 --> 00:19:48.554
Toys, games...

00:19:49.063 --> 00:19:51.588
That’s right,
I’ll give you lots of them.

00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:53.868
Listen...

00:19:53.868 --> 00:19:56.496
I’m not gonna become your vassal!

00:19:58.973 --> 00:20:03.535
Quit looking down on people already!
Sheesh!

00:20:17.258 --> 00:20:19.123
I can’t stand it any longer!

00:20:19.394 --> 00:20:21.419
International incident or whatever...!

00:20:21.562 --> 00:20:23.427
Who cares?! Believe it!

00:20:34.542 --> 00:20:38.379
You think you can get
your way every time?

00:20:38.379 --> 00:20:40.404
Well, you’re mistaken big time!

00:20:40.648 --> 00:20:42.717
Hey! Naruto!

00:20:42.717 --> 00:20:44.582
What the hell did you do?!

00:20:45.086 --> 00:20:46.781
Well, because he...

00:21:08.543 --> 00:21:10.977
Prince! Go! Go!

00:21:11.479 --> 00:21:13.242
This feels great!

00:21:13.448 --> 00:21:16.679
This makes me forget
everything negative!

00:21:17.318 --> 00:21:20.754
No way! It wasn’t my fault!

00:21:21.189 --> 00:21:25.523
Still, you hit him!
You’d better apologize.

00:21:25.827 --> 00:21:27.028
No way! No way!

00:21:27.028 --> 00:21:28.359
I absolutely refuse!

00:21:28.963 --> 00:21:29.861
I see!

00:21:33.334 --> 00:21:34.961
Then you’re not forgiven yet.

00:22:04.532 --> 00:22:05.328
Here.

00:22:46.240 --> 00:22:47.502
What’s with you?!

00:22:52.413 --> 00:22:53.880
The new moon has passed.

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:00.087
Astonn...?

00:23:16.604 --> 00:23:21.166
My lord! The cargos on
the deck are in peril!

00:23:21.842 --> 00:23:24.037
Huh? Then do something.

00:23:24.745 --> 00:23:26.940
It’s a waste to have them fall
into the sea.

00:23:28.449 --> 00:23:32.044
So please do your best!
We’ll pay you extra for this.

00:23:32.086 --> 00:23:35.055
That’s ﬁne. I feel sorry for
the animals anyway.

00:23:35.223 --> 00:23:37.625
Then please work with
the circus people

00:23:37.625 --> 00:23:38.592
and take care of this.

00:23:42.363 --> 00:23:43.330
Oww!

00:23:44.265 --> 00:23:46.028
Let’s go, Naruto.

00:23:46.200 --> 00:23:48.100
Ouch! Ouch...

00:23:49.870 --> 00:23:52.270
Oh, what the hell...

00:23:53.474 --> 00:23:54.668
Who cares about them?

00:23:54.742 --> 00:23:57.677
Huh? What do you mean?

00:23:58.980 --> 00:24:02.916
I’m tired of the animals.
Just leave them.

00:24:05.820 --> 00:24:06.912
Are you...

00:24:06.954 --> 00:24:08.751
Are you serious?

00:24:08.856 --> 00:24:12.656
Huh? Well, it’s dangerous
if you go outside...

00:24:13.561 --> 00:24:16.325
You’re really the worst kind of trash!

00:24:16.764 --> 00:24:18.833
You brought them here
on a whim!

00:24:18.833 --> 00:24:22.132
But now you’re bored,
so you’ll abandon them?!

00:24:22.403 --> 00:24:25.930
You’ll let them die,
and you don’t even care?!

00:24:31.212 --> 00:24:34.613
You’re so pathetic,
it’s not worth hitting you!

00:24:36.050 --> 00:24:39.042
Trash like you can go under
the covers and sleep!

00:25:09.116 --> 00:25:10.674
I’m not trash!

00:25:45.419 --> 00:25:46.351
Kikki!

00:26:01.335 --> 00:26:03.428
It’s useless...

00:26:19.987 --> 00:26:21.045
Laddie!

00:26:21.555 --> 00:26:23.079
Stop! Laddie!

00:26:40.174 --> 00:26:41.198
That kid?!

00:27:02.730 --> 00:27:03.560
Hikaru!

00:27:09.003 --> 00:27:09.992
Hikaru!

00:27:25.786 --> 00:27:26.753
Hikaru!

00:27:43.170 --> 00:27:43.966
Hikaru!

00:28:11.966 --> 00:28:12.933
Huh?

00:28:21.475 --> 00:28:23.466
No, laddie! Watch out!

00:28:59.346 --> 00:29:03.282
Unbelievable!
That Chamu taking to a human...

00:29:03.817 --> 00:29:04.749
Go!

00:29:15.429 --> 00:29:17.454
Say... Umm...

00:29:19.667 --> 00:29:21.032
— Sorry!
— Huh?

00:29:21.068 --> 00:29:25.630
Sorry I hit you! And also...
for saying mean things. Sorry!

00:29:27.041 --> 00:29:29.066
Hikaru... You’re amazing.

00:29:29.310 --> 00:29:32.473
Reckless, but you have
amazing courage.

00:29:34.982 --> 00:29:37.952
He probably acknowledges it too...

00:29:37.952 --> 00:29:39.385
your bravery.

00:29:44.224 --> 00:29:45.088
Me too!

00:29:49.597 --> 00:29:53.158
I’m sorry, too! I did such
a terrible thing to you.

00:29:56.270 --> 00:29:58.397
And...l’m sorry, Chamu.

00:29:59.239 --> 00:30:02.697
You didn’t accept me,
so I got mad and...

00:30:03.577 --> 00:30:07.069
Actually, I wanted you and Naruto
to be my friends.

00:30:07.615 --> 00:30:10.140
I wanted everyone to play with me...

00:30:12.853 --> 00:30:14.377
Yet I...

00:30:15.990 --> 00:30:18.481
Come on, come on! Was that all?

00:30:19.526 --> 00:30:21.528
Friends, huh? Sure thing.

00:30:21.528 --> 00:30:24.088
From this moment on,
you and l are friends!

00:30:25.232 --> 00:30:26.199
Really?

00:30:26.567 --> 00:30:27.261
Sure!

00:30:33.574 --> 00:30:35.633
Even these guys wanna be friends.

00:30:36.243 --> 00:30:37.210
Me too!

00:30:37.544 --> 00:30:38.442
I also!

00:30:45.519 --> 00:30:46.486
What’s wrong?

00:30:46.887 --> 00:30:52.621
Once we reach the islands,
you’ll be leaving again.

00:30:53.894 --> 00:30:55.191
Oh, yeah...

00:30:57.998 --> 00:30:59.431
Then it’s a promise!

00:30:59.566 --> 00:31:00.464
Huh?

00:31:00.701 --> 00:31:02.896
A promise that we’ll always
be friends!

00:31:03.871 --> 00:31:05.532
I won’t forget you.

00:31:06.040 --> 00:31:09.271
So you have to always
remember us, okay?

00:31:14.848 --> 00:31:15.644
Okay!

00:31:19.053 --> 00:31:20.816
Hey, just the two of you?

00:31:21.055 --> 00:31:22.613
Oh, sorry!

00:31:28.095 --> 00:31:29.460
All of you...

00:31:29.630 --> 00:31:32.224
We’ll always,
always remain friends, okay?

00:31:32.566 --> 00:31:33.464
Right!

00:31:33.734 --> 00:31:34.462
Yeah!

00:31:34.802 --> 00:31:35.598
Yes!

00:32:26.587 --> 00:32:28.111
Come over later.

00:32:28.222 --> 00:32:30.417
Yes, I shall visit you.

00:32:30.858 --> 00:32:31.825
Let’s go!

00:32:44.638 --> 00:32:47.129
This rich island enveloped by nature.

00:32:49.176 --> 00:32:51.974
Coral beaches before your very eyes!

00:32:53.647 --> 00:32:56.013
After watching the sunset
while enjoying a tropical drink...

00:33:00.821 --> 00:33:03.221
come over to the Casino Mikazuki!

00:33:04.224 --> 00:33:09.127
Strange. This street is
usually very lively.

00:33:10.097 --> 00:33:11.462
No one’s around.

00:33:42.963 --> 00:33:44.828
No one’s come out to greet us.

00:33:48.669 --> 00:33:50.159
Oh, Shabadaba!

00:33:51.238 --> 00:33:53.433
Well, well, Michiru!

00:33:53.607 --> 00:33:56.838
You must be tired from journeying
to the various lands.

00:33:57.511 --> 00:33:59.911
Hikaru looks well, too.

00:34:00.314 --> 00:34:02.714
Yes, thank you, Shabadaba.

00:34:03.150 --> 00:34:07.109
Say, things in town seem strange.
Did something happen?

00:34:10.624 --> 00:34:11.648
Shabadaba...

00:34:17.531 --> 00:34:21.023
Where’s Papa? I don’t see him.

00:34:22.536 --> 00:34:23.764
The King...

00:34:25.138 --> 00:34:26.298
passed away!

00:34:27.074 --> 00:34:27.699
Huh?!

00:34:35.582 --> 00:34:38.517
From now, I will inherit the throne!

00:34:39.086 --> 00:34:41.452
So you are in my way, Prince!

00:34:44.391 --> 00:34:45.619
Kill them!

00:34:46.994 --> 00:34:48.154
Naruto! Sakura! Lee!

00:35:00.641 --> 00:35:02.939
Your Highness! Hikaru!
Get in the carriage!

00:35:10.651 --> 00:35:11.447
Take them out the gates!

00:35:28.235 --> 00:35:30.203
There’s just no end to this!

00:35:32.706 --> 00:35:33.604
Reinforcements?

00:35:41.782 --> 00:35:42.749
It’s Korega!

00:35:43.150 --> 00:35:44.048
Captain Korega!

00:35:45.819 --> 00:35:49.311
He is a traitor! Slay him!

00:35:49.723 --> 00:35:50.951
That’s nonsense!

00:35:53.093 --> 00:35:54.321
Come to your senses!

00:35:56.396 --> 00:35:58.591
The Minister is the one behind this!

00:36:01.368 --> 00:36:03.768
How can comrade ﬁght comrade?!
How senseless!

00:36:06.640 --> 00:36:08.904
Thank you! Who are you all?

00:36:09.409 --> 00:36:11.877
We’re Shinobi from Leaf Village
hired by the Prince.

00:36:11.979 --> 00:36:13.913
Oh, that’s reassuring!

00:36:14.448 --> 00:36:15.574
In any case,
we have to get out of here.

00:36:16.516 --> 00:36:17.608
Please take care of the carriage.

00:36:17.918 --> 00:36:18.680
Understood!

00:36:37.070 --> 00:36:38.731
Who are those guys?

00:36:45.445 --> 00:36:46.412
Hmm...

00:36:47.080 --> 00:36:47.978
Hah.

00:36:49.349 --> 00:36:50.680
They’re pretty good.

00:36:52.119 --> 00:36:53.984
Thank goodness
you're all skilled fighters.

00:36:54.554 --> 00:36:57.114
I apologize for not relaying information
on the situation sooner.

00:36:57.190 --> 00:36:58.122
Where to from now?

00:36:58.291 --> 00:37:01.488
Our comrades are in the mountains.
We’ll go there for now!

00:37:06.767 --> 00:37:09.497
I must say, there’s no one around.

00:37:10.070 --> 00:37:13.096
Is this the kind of place
the Land of Moon is?

00:37:18.478 --> 00:37:21.038
That’s the Prince’s carriage!

00:37:38.832 --> 00:37:40.527
— Papa!
— Grandpa!

00:37:40.934 --> 00:37:42.265
Papa! Papa?!

00:37:42.302 --> 00:37:43.132
Grandpa!

00:37:43.236 --> 00:37:44.328
What happened, Papa?!

00:37:44.404 --> 00:37:46.929
That old man is the King?

00:37:49.676 --> 00:37:53.914
The Chief Minister Shabadaba
and other ministers had clashed lately

00:37:53.914 --> 00:37:57.315
with the King over future policies
of the country.

00:37:59.019 --> 00:38:00.620
Still, the King hoped that
one day

00:38:00.620 --> 00:38:03.783
they would understand his intentions.

00:38:04.424 --> 00:38:08.724
However, secretly...
they plotted an overthrow.

00:38:10.230 --> 00:38:14.599
Luckily, we learned of this
and reported it to the King.

00:38:14.901 --> 00:38:18.359
Finally, the King resolved to deal
with his ministers.

00:38:19.106 --> 00:38:21.108
And as a precautionary measure,

00:38:21.108 --> 00:38:24.711
he sent the Prince and Master Hikaru
out of the country

00:38:24.711 --> 00:38:27.179
on the pretense of visiting
other nations.

00:38:28.415 --> 00:38:29.313
That's...

00:38:30.750 --> 00:38:32.149
That’s the real reason?

00:38:32.819 --> 00:38:33.843
That’s...!

00:38:34.654 --> 00:38:35.856
During that time,

00:38:35.856 --> 00:38:38.347
His Majesty wanted to settle
the matter.

00:38:39.259 --> 00:38:42.696
However, the Chief Minister
had already hired mercenary Shinobi

00:38:42.696 --> 00:38:44.857
and reinforced his strength.

00:38:46.166 --> 00:38:47.868
We were outmanned beyond
our expectations...

00:38:47.868 --> 00:38:50.234
and got away in the knick of time.

00:38:51.938 --> 00:38:54.702
However, the King was...

00:38:57.644 --> 00:38:58.838
Grandpa!

00:39:01.748 --> 00:39:03.443
Let me see his wound.

00:39:10.590 --> 00:39:11.648
It's...

00:39:11.958 --> 00:39:13.186
It's turned to stone?!

00:39:13.660 --> 00:39:16.096
It seems there is one among
the enemy Shinobi

00:39:16.096 --> 00:39:18.394
who uses a special Jutsu.

00:39:19.366 --> 00:39:23.735
Due to our negligence,
the King fell victim to its poison fang!

00:39:26.039 --> 00:39:26.767
How is he?

00:39:26.973 --> 00:39:28.406
I’ll give it a try anyway.

00:39:40.053 --> 00:39:41.611
How terrible!

00:39:41.788 --> 00:39:43.483
We let them get away!

00:39:44.758 --> 00:39:46.953
Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!

00:39:47.627 --> 00:39:50.255
They were quite strong.

00:39:50.797 --> 00:39:52.856
What’ll you do, Ishidate?!

00:39:53.533 --> 00:39:54.864
Calm down.

00:39:55.435 --> 00:39:58.302
They may be strong,
but they’re no match for us.

00:39:58.939 --> 00:40:00.668
We’ll deal with them immediately.

00:40:00.907 --> 00:40:06.402
Of course! That’s why we paid
good money to hire you!

00:40:11.952 --> 00:40:12.919
How is it, Sakura?

00:40:13.353 --> 00:40:15.321
Stopping a stone transformation
is no problem.

00:40:16.189 --> 00:40:20.888
But if attacked during battle,
immediate treatment is necessary...

00:40:21.461 --> 00:40:22.393
I see.

00:40:23.630 --> 00:40:26.565
Also, the King probably...

00:40:28.201 --> 00:40:30.328
won’t make it...

00:40:36.977 --> 00:40:39.445
You have returned, Michiru.

00:40:39.579 --> 00:40:40.409
Papa!

00:40:41.014 --> 00:40:41.708
Grandpa!

00:40:42.382 --> 00:40:43.314
Your Majesty!

00:40:43.617 --> 00:40:44.914
Hikaru, too?

00:40:46.486 --> 00:40:47.817
Thank goodness!

00:40:49.556 --> 00:40:51.114
I see...

00:40:51.491 --> 00:40:54.085
so you protected Michiru and Hikaru.

00:40:55.895 --> 00:40:58.625
Thank you so much.

00:40:59.899 --> 00:41:02.993
And, how are things in the country?

00:41:04.037 --> 00:41:09.134
Unfortunately, as it is,
it will fall to the rebels.

00:41:10.577 --> 00:41:11.942
I see...

00:41:14.381 --> 00:41:19.614
Michiru, what do you think
of this country?

00:41:20.020 --> 00:41:23.319
Well? It’s very prosperous
and beautiful and...

00:41:23.657 --> 00:41:25.022
it’s a great country.

00:41:25.925 --> 00:41:32.091
But I don’t think affluence alone
ensures happiness.

00:41:32.365 --> 00:41:33.389
What?

00:41:36.569 --> 00:41:42.769
Happy faces. Joy. Hope.
And dreams.

00:41:44.811 --> 00:41:47.575
Overflowing with peace and kindness...

00:41:47.614 --> 00:41:50.242
That’s the kind of country I envisioned.

00:41:50.684 --> 00:41:56.953
But Shabadama who I thought
supported me did not understand...

00:41:57.257 --> 00:41:58.747
How regrettable.

00:42:02.796 --> 00:42:04.491
You are just like Amayo.

00:42:05.432 --> 00:42:08.333
You saw her’? How does she fare?

00:42:12.005 --> 00:42:13.438
I see...

00:42:13.773 --> 00:42:16.765
She told me I don’t understand
what’s truly precious.

00:42:17.344 --> 00:42:20.438
She’s very shrewd, as usual.

00:42:21.614 --> 00:42:28.486
If she constantly harped at you,
I thought it would work out perfectly.

00:42:28.688 --> 00:42:34.456
Little did I imagine that she would
get tired of you ﬁrst. It’s too bad...

00:42:37.897 --> 00:42:41.458
I see... What’s truly precious, huh?

00:42:50.510 --> 00:42:51.670
Michiru...

00:42:52.545 --> 00:42:53.341
What is it?

00:42:54.647 --> 00:42:57.616
As my ﬁnal request,
hear me out...

00:43:00.787 --> 00:43:01.685
Grandpa!

00:43:02.055 --> 00:43:05.252
— It's something very important!
— Final? What are you saying, Papa!

00:43:05.291 --> 00:43:12.220
— I regret that it must be in this situation.
—Are you listening? Hey Papa! Papa!

00:43:12.365 --> 00:43:13.855
Papa!

00:43:13.933 --> 00:43:17.266
You must inherit the throne.

00:43:25.812 --> 00:43:27.336
You Ninja...

00:43:30.483 --> 00:43:31.211
Yes.

00:43:32.118 --> 00:43:35.713
I know it’s asking much, but please...

00:43:36.556 --> 00:43:41.584
this is my ﬁnal request...

00:43:42.128 --> 00:43:43.095
What is it?

00:43:44.197 --> 00:43:48.463
Please protect these two.

00:43:49.002 --> 00:43:51.232
We shall, even at the cost of our lives.

00:43:55.041 --> 00:43:56.133
Thank you.

00:43:58.711 --> 00:44:03.011
Michiru... I am counting on you.

00:44:21.768 --> 00:44:23.497
Papa!

00:44:34.147 --> 00:44:37.014
Grandpa was always kind to me.

00:44:38.318 --> 00:44:40.252
He even made this bow for me.

00:44:41.020 --> 00:44:45.158
l practiced hard and
when I got a bull’s eye,

00:44:45.158 --> 00:44:46.887
he was so happy for me.

00:44:49.629 --> 00:44:50.891
I loved him so much.

00:44:54.467 --> 00:44:57.800
Did you understand what
your grandfather was trying to say?

00:45:03.643 --> 00:45:06.111
I sorta understand.

00:45:08.214 --> 00:45:10.409
It’s about what happens in here.

00:45:15.121 --> 00:45:19.421
Old Man Hokage took good care
of me before he died, too.

00:45:20.293 --> 00:45:24.998
But he left the village,
its people and me

00:45:24.998 --> 00:45:27.660
with lots and lots of precious things.

00:45:28.201 --> 00:45:33.434
So I’m definitely gonna become
the Hokage and protect it all.

00:45:34.674 --> 00:45:37.744
I think your grandpa wants
you and your father

00:45:37.744 --> 00:45:42.306
to protect those precious things, too.

00:45:44.350 --> 00:45:46.978
Protect what’s precious?

00:45:58.565 --> 00:46:01.329
Can I do it, though?

00:46:01.501 --> 00:46:04.061
Of course! You can do it!

00:46:04.737 --> 00:46:05.601
But...

00:46:12.111 --> 00:46:16.015
Listen. Someday, when we’re
the Hokage and the King,

00:46:16.015 --> 00:46:17.915
let’s make our countries friends, too!

00:46:18.017 --> 00:46:18.847
Huh?

00:46:19.018 --> 00:46:23.114
And if ever you have trouble,
I’ll come to your aid right away.

00:46:23.289 --> 00:46:26.486
So you come to mine, okay?

00:46:32.599 --> 00:46:33.395
Okay?

00:46:35.501 --> 00:46:36.365
Uh-huh!

00:46:36.669 --> 00:46:38.330
Then it’s a promise!

00:46:44.711 --> 00:46:48.169
We’ll be friends forever!

00:46:50.083 --> 00:46:51.107
Forever!

00:46:55.488 --> 00:46:57.285
Our military power is weak.

00:46:57.857 --> 00:47:00.621
There are not enough of us to
stand up against the Minister.

00:47:01.394 --> 00:47:03.363
For now, we’ll evacuate
the Prince and Master Hikaru

00:47:03.363 --> 00:47:05.092
outside the country.

00:47:06.032 --> 00:47:08.034
We’ll strengthen our forces
with our allies.

00:47:08.034 --> 00:47:10.161
That would be the best strategy.

00:47:24.550 --> 00:47:25.517
Not yet?

00:47:34.427 --> 00:47:35.359
Captain Korega!

00:47:36.562 --> 00:47:38.689
A boat is waiting outside the bay.

00:47:39.132 --> 00:47:40.622
Good work.

00:47:43.970 --> 00:47:44.664
Let’s go.

00:47:52.612 --> 00:47:53.476
Papa!

00:47:54.380 --> 00:47:55.847
Come on! Let’s go!

00:48:11.164 --> 00:48:12.722
Wait!

00:48:14.934 --> 00:48:15.764
Go ahead.

00:48:20.506 --> 00:48:22.030
Hey stand up!

00:48:22.642 --> 00:48:25.270
I know that!

00:48:43.696 --> 00:48:45.994
Are you guys that stupid?

00:48:46.466 --> 00:48:48.730
The coastline is carefully watched.

00:48:49.435 --> 00:48:53.030
We’re also aware that
you arranged for boats.

00:48:54.807 --> 00:48:58.004
Hand over that guy and the kid.

00:49:00.012 --> 00:49:02.344
Don’t kid yourself!
As if we’d hand them over!

00:49:05.284 --> 00:49:06.979
You’re a spunky kid.

00:49:07.186 --> 00:49:07.845
Huh?

00:49:19.065 --> 00:49:19.929
What’s the matter?

00:49:21.467 --> 00:49:23.298
Where are you aiming?

00:49:28.141 --> 00:49:29.073
That’s enough.

00:49:29.275 --> 00:49:30.105
I wonder about that.

00:49:51.798 --> 00:49:52.992
Why you—!

00:49:58.938 --> 00:50:01.668
— Lee!
— How dare you do that to Naruto!

00:50:06.445 --> 00:50:07.434
You too...

00:50:07.847 --> 00:50:08.973
die!

00:50:14.353 --> 00:50:17.481
Shinobi from Hidden Leaf?
I’ve heard rumors about you.

00:50:17.857 --> 00:50:20.291
But I wonder who’s better.

00:50:21.260 --> 00:50:22.591
We’ll soon find out.

00:50:41.147 --> 00:50:42.045
Just now...

00:50:47.920 --> 00:50:50.514
Huh? I’m sure I dodged it.

00:50:52.625 --> 00:50:53.387
Strange. . .

00:50:57.697 --> 00:50:59.665
Our moves seem slow.

00:51:04.704 --> 00:51:07.104
Could our senses be off?

00:51:08.040 --> 00:51:09.837
Genjutsu? When did they...?!

00:51:11.544 --> 00:51:12.169
Release!

00:51:21.954 --> 00:51:24.946
It’s useless.
This is not Genjutsu.

00:51:25.892 --> 00:51:28.326
I get it!
It’s that Paper Bomb earlier!

00:51:29.028 --> 00:51:31.428
Yes. It’s an odorless poison mist.

00:51:31.831 --> 00:51:34.493
Once you breathe it in,
your five senses go awry.

00:51:35.001 --> 00:51:37.469
For a while,
you won’t be able to battle in earnest!

00:51:46.012 --> 00:51:49.743
Who is superior?
It seems this battle is already won.

00:52:01.594 --> 00:52:04.188
I’ll be your opponent now.

00:52:06.632 --> 00:52:10.090
I will avenge our late King!

00:52:22.848 --> 00:52:24.873
Help!

00:52:26.252 --> 00:52:27.617
Prince Michiru!

00:52:38.164 --> 00:52:39.461
Korega!

00:52:40.299 --> 00:52:42.358
— Huh?!
— Captain!

00:52:48.174 --> 00:52:52.167
Hmm... That’s a pretty
amazing expression.

00:52:54.046 --> 00:52:56.071
It’s almost a work of art.

00:52:58.084 --> 00:53:00.575
However, it’s a failure!

00:53:06.759 --> 00:53:08.454
Captain!

00:53:12.164 --> 00:53:13.995
Why you—!

00:53:38.758 --> 00:53:41.886
I expected a bit more fun.

00:53:43.029 --> 00:53:44.462
Are we about to finish things here?

00:53:46.065 --> 00:53:47.327
How unfortunate.

00:53:48.434 --> 00:53:49.833
Brat!

00:53:52.271 --> 00:53:53.932
Help!

00:54:20.266 --> 00:54:21.255
Kongou!

00:54:55.734 --> 00:54:57.463
Who is that kid?!

00:55:11.183 --> 00:55:14.243
Kongou! Kalenbana!
We retreat for now.

00:55:28.334 --> 00:55:29.528
Sensei!

00:55:36.475 --> 00:55:37.772
Drats!

00:55:43.315 --> 00:55:45.010
Captain... !

00:55:48.888 --> 00:55:50.219
Papa...

00:55:55.494 --> 00:55:56.722
Korega...

00:56:13.879 --> 00:56:15.848
Oh dear dear...

00:56:15.848 --> 00:56:18.908
You made us search quite hard,
Prince Michiru.

00:56:19.318 --> 00:56:22.219
Why?! Weren’t you Papa’s comrade?!

00:56:23.022 --> 00:56:24.490
And yet...

00:56:24.490 --> 00:56:26.754
How could you do such a terrible thing?!

00:56:27.693 --> 00:56:30.423
Comrade? Don’t be ridiculous!

00:56:31.330 --> 00:56:36.632
Your father had too many ideals.

00:56:36.769 --> 00:56:41.240
He wanted to help the elderly
and the downtrodden...

00:56:41.240 --> 00:56:44.266
and wanted the country
to subsidize their aid.

00:56:44.410 --> 00:56:47.379
And still, he wanted to lower taxes!

00:56:47.513 --> 00:56:51.279
— This and that...so ridiculous!
— Papa had such ideas?

00:56:51.951 --> 00:56:53.619
For example...

00:56:53.619 --> 00:56:58.249
Why do you think you can eat
your fill of delicious foods?

00:57:01.694 --> 00:57:06.654
It’s because the country is prosperous
that you can eat all you want, right?

00:57:07.900 --> 00:57:11.971
And yet, he insists that everything
is for the sake of the people?!

00:57:11.971 --> 00:57:16.533
It’s our duty to protect the people
who are our treasure?!

00:57:16.809 --> 00:57:19.141
That’s utter...nonsense!

00:57:20.613 --> 00:57:21.747
Now listen!

00:57:21.747 --> 00:57:26.844
What’s important in this world
is money, money, money...

00:57:26.986 --> 00:57:29.045
Money is everything!

00:57:30.856 --> 00:57:34.292
That means you just want
to get rich!

00:57:36.862 --> 00:57:39.990
Right! I want more.

00:57:40.165 --> 00:57:45.899
I want to fill my coffers...
fatten up like you!

00:57:48.641 --> 00:57:52.202
And that’s why you killed Papa...

00:57:52.811 --> 00:57:55.780
However, he’s dead.

00:57:56.715 --> 00:57:59.809
And I will become King!

00:57:59.985 --> 00:58:02.749
No! I will be King!

00:58:04.390 --> 00:58:06.756
I wonder about that?

00:58:22.741 --> 00:58:24.368
Oh? How did it go?

00:58:24.643 --> 00:58:27.111
The security is too tight.
I couldn’t inﬁltrate.

00:58:27.246 --> 00:58:30.215
But one thing is certain,
we don’t have time.

00:58:36.855 --> 00:58:39.915
Maybe we should just give up?

00:58:41.026 --> 00:58:42.891
How can we do that?!

00:58:43.028 --> 00:58:44.791
But what’ll we do then?

00:58:44.930 --> 00:58:47.262
There’s so few of us!

00:58:47.966 --> 00:58:51.129
Even if these people are strong,
it’s impossible!

00:58:58.077 --> 00:58:59.278
At the very least,

00:58:59.278 --> 00:59:01.508
we should help Master Hikaru
escape the country...

00:59:05.351 --> 00:59:06.682
Papa!

00:59:22.167 --> 00:59:24.863
Let’s go. We’ll go save him.

00:59:25.170 --> 00:59:26.330
Boy, that’s...!

00:59:26.405 --> 00:59:29.203
What else can we do?!
Isn’t that so?

00:59:29.341 --> 00:59:30.501
It’s impossible!

00:59:31.677 --> 00:59:33.269
We can’t save him.

00:59:33.412 --> 00:59:35.607
After all... After all...

00:59:35.881 --> 00:59:37.508
Papa will be killed!

00:59:54.867 --> 00:59:55.891
Hikaru...

00:59:58.270 --> 00:59:59.396
Hikaru...

01:00:09.114 --> 01:00:12.174
Are you going to forsake it again?

01:00:15.954 --> 01:00:18.752
Are you gonna give up again?

01:00:23.529 --> 01:00:29.161
I really believed that
you were awesome.

01:00:30.302 --> 01:00:31.769
Are you gonna forsake it all?!

01:00:32.037 --> 01:00:35.165
Your father? Your courage?!

01:00:36.742 --> 01:00:38.209
Our promise?!

01:00:41.280 --> 01:00:42.872
Are you gonna abandon it all?!

01:00:45.083 --> 01:00:49.042
The things that are precious to you?!

01:01:15.747 --> 01:01:17.510
I’m going.

01:01:18.750 --> 01:01:21.275
I’m going to save Papa!

01:01:24.823 --> 01:01:26.188
Let’s go!

01:01:26.558 --> 01:01:27.893
Master Hikaru!
Don’t be so rash!

01:01:27.893 --> 01:01:30.521
Don’t worry, Mister.

01:01:31.430 --> 01:01:34.194
I’ll protect Hikaru.

01:01:35.267 --> 01:01:37.895
No matter what happens...l will!

01:01:40.272 --> 01:01:42.240
— Let’s go!
— Yes, let's!

01:01:43.041 --> 01:01:45.532
We have our promise with
the late King.

01:01:46.545 --> 01:01:49.605
We should take a lesson
from their courage.

01:02:01.593 --> 01:02:03.493
Chamu! Kikki!

01:02:07.366 --> 01:02:08.890
Hey, Chamu!

01:02:09.535 --> 01:02:11.002
What’s with you, all of sudden?

01:02:13.739 --> 01:02:16.173
Oh! It’s you all!

01:02:17.910 --> 01:02:20.112
We saw the Prince’s carriage taking off

01:02:20.112 --> 01:02:22.981
and I thought it strange,
so I went to the palace...

01:02:22.981 --> 01:02:26.644
We were turned away and
then threatened by the soldiers.

01:02:26.885 --> 01:02:28.820
I thought they were gonna kill
the animals,

01:02:28.820 --> 01:02:30.981
so we fled into this forest.

01:02:31.256 --> 01:02:34.693
It’s not what we agreed upon,
if we don’t get paid the cash!

01:02:34.693 --> 01:02:37.321
— Why’d we come to this island anyway?!
— I see...

01:02:37.763 --> 01:02:43.167
Now, just explain please.
What on earth is going on?!

01:02:43.368 --> 01:02:46.360
Manager, I don’t blame you
for getting upset.

01:02:47.205 --> 01:02:48.774
With all of you circus members...

01:02:48.774 --> 01:02:52.574
if you don’t get paid,
now that’s a problem. Right?

01:03:03.055 --> 01:03:05.615
No, no, no, no! Stop!

01:03:05.791 --> 01:03:07.816
Stop! No!

01:03:08.026 --> 01:03:09.493
No! No!

01:03:13.532 --> 01:03:15.033
For the longest time,

01:03:15.033 --> 01:03:18.332
I’ve wanted to execute
a criminal like this.

01:03:22.708 --> 01:03:25.643
Stop resisting, Michiru.

01:03:25.911 --> 01:03:27.105
Otherwise...

01:03:32.951 --> 01:03:35.112
Remove the blindfold.

01:03:43.662 --> 01:03:44.788
Do it.

01:03:52.104 --> 01:03:57.064
Please don’t fall right away.
Otherwise, it won’t be any fun.

01:04:51.396 --> 01:04:58.461
Happy faces. Joy. Hope.
And dreams.

01:04:59.337 --> 01:05:01.540
Overflowing with peace and kindness...

01:05:01.540 --> 01:05:04.407
That’s the kind of country I envisioned.

01:05:06.645 --> 01:05:07.805
Papa...

01:05:08.680 --> 01:05:09.704
Hmm?

01:05:42.314 --> 01:05:44.441
Here again?!

01:05:44.716 --> 01:05:46.513
Well, err...

01:05:46.551 --> 01:05:48.018
Get out of here!

01:05:48.253 --> 01:05:49.948
Strange!

01:05:50.655 --> 01:05:53.852
We were summoned here
to put on a performance.

01:05:54.159 --> 01:05:55.990
We haven’t heard anything
of the sort.

01:05:56.194 --> 01:05:59.095
That can’t be...

01:05:59.231 --> 01:06:00.198
You know?

01:06:08.273 --> 01:06:09.501
What is that?

01:06:09.741 --> 01:06:11.208
Entertainment.

01:06:11.777 --> 01:06:14.075
It’s no fun to kill him right away.

01:06:20.318 --> 01:06:21.080
What is that?

01:06:23.121 --> 01:06:24.918
The circus bunch?

01:06:25.657 --> 01:06:27.352
Why were they allowed in?

01:06:27.759 --> 01:06:29.522
I’ll order them out immediately.

01:06:32.697 --> 01:06:33.527
Now!

01:06:33.732 --> 01:06:37.293
Just a minute.
I was getting bored.

01:06:38.136 --> 01:06:39.694
Because of him!

01:06:49.447 --> 01:06:51.642
I hear there’s a circus in town.

01:06:51.750 --> 01:06:53.047
Wanna go see?

01:07:13.905 --> 01:07:14.837
All clear.

01:07:16.441 --> 01:07:21.037
Only we, the King’s guards,
know of this secret passage.

01:07:23.248 --> 01:07:24.613
Master Hikaru.

01:07:25.550 --> 01:07:27.040
Please use these.

01:07:27.686 --> 01:07:31.247
I made it to your size.
I hope it will be of use.

01:07:32.524 --> 01:07:33.422
Thank you!

01:07:34.392 --> 01:07:35.416
Let’s go!

01:07:37.229 --> 01:07:38.964
According to Kakashi Sensei’s
message,

01:07:38.964 --> 01:07:41.762
Prince Michiru is on
the top floor terrace.

01:07:42.033 --> 01:07:44.695
We must hurry.
He said the situation is critical.

01:07:56.114 --> 01:07:56.910
Miss...

01:07:58.116 --> 01:07:59.242
Kakashi Sensei!

01:07:59.918 --> 01:08:02.546
Let the dogs from the pet shop go!

01:08:02.821 --> 01:08:05.757
— Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes!
— Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes! Yes! Wow!

01:08:05.757 --> 01:08:10.421
— Aruaru Expedition Team!
— Aruaru Expedition Team!

01:08:10.528 --> 01:08:12.155
It’s about the time we get to it.

01:08:19.070 --> 01:08:22.005
We’ve come to the climax
of our performance.

01:08:23.475 --> 01:08:25.966
Please enjoy...this!

01:08:27.779 --> 01:08:28.768
Who is that?!

01:08:41.259 --> 01:08:42.886
Ishidate!

01:08:43.328 --> 01:08:44.352
I know!

01:08:45.363 --> 01:08:47.354
Attack!

01:08:50.769 --> 01:08:53.033
They’re not here to rescue him?!

01:08:54.873 --> 01:08:55.999
How's that?!

01:08:57.108 --> 01:08:58.507
Go!

01:09:02.247 --> 01:09:03.578
Don't kill us!

01:09:03.748 --> 01:09:06.717
I wouldn’t have agreed to help
if I knew it would be like this!

01:09:31.009 --> 01:09:32.033
Hikaru...

01:09:32.610 --> 01:09:35.078
Do you trust me?

01:09:35.613 --> 01:09:36.545
Uh-huh!

01:09:36.848 --> 01:09:37.678
Awright!

01:09:37.782 --> 01:09:43.186
I promise you. I will protect you.
No matter what!

01:09:45.890 --> 01:09:47.721
— Me too!
— I also!

01:09:54.733 --> 01:09:55.859
Let us go!

01:09:56.601 --> 01:09:59.468
The top ﬂoor terrace means
it’s the throne room.

01:09:59.838 --> 01:10:01.829
If we get there now,
when there are few soldiers...

01:10:05.977 --> 01:10:10.311
He was right.
The leader is shrewd, after all.

01:10:10.882 --> 01:10:12.384
We knew from the start

01:10:12.384 --> 01:10:14.614
that the commotion outside
was a diversion.

01:10:15.487 --> 01:10:16.621
I’ll handle him.

01:10:16.621 --> 01:10:19.647
No, I will. I’ll ﬁght him.

01:10:19.858 --> 01:10:21.120
Bushy Brow!

01:10:21.292 --> 01:10:24.352
It’s my policy, to always even the score.

01:10:26.097 --> 01:10:27.928
We’re counting on you,
Bushy Brow.

01:10:28.600 --> 01:10:29.862
Hold it!

01:10:37.809 --> 01:10:39.868
This time, I won’t go easy on you!

01:10:43.948 --> 01:10:45.415
Just how I want it!

01:10:56.795 --> 01:10:57.784
Sakura?

01:11:00.765 --> 01:11:02.528
How did you know?

01:11:02.801 --> 01:11:04.530
You stink, that’s why.

01:11:05.437 --> 01:11:08.600
A kid like you wearing perfume.
Such bad taste!

01:11:08.640 --> 01:11:09.732
Kid?!

01:11:10.141 --> 01:11:12.268
I’ll take care of her. Go on ahead.

01:11:12.510 --> 01:11:14.444
Did you call me kid?!

01:11:20.452 --> 01:11:22.784
I’m already 22!

01:11:23.655 --> 01:11:24.519
No way!

01:11:31.162 --> 01:11:32.151
Papa!

01:11:32.797 --> 01:11:33.957
Hikaru!

01:11:34.365 --> 01:11:37.129
They’re...in the throne room,
after all!

01:11:49.781 --> 01:11:50.839
Sir!

01:11:52.450 --> 01:11:53.917
Why you—!

01:12:06.464 --> 01:12:07.988
Hikaru!

01:12:08.900 --> 01:12:11.994
Your strategy was doomed
from the start.

01:12:15.373 --> 01:12:16.397
Die!

01:12:20.778 --> 01:12:21.710
Chamu!

01:12:21.813 --> 01:12:22.973
What?!

01:12:25.350 --> 01:12:26.544
Chamu!

01:12:33.525 --> 01:12:34.549
The fools...

01:12:43.601 --> 01:12:44.499
Now!

01:12:53.144 --> 01:12:54.304
Why you—!

01:13:22.540 --> 01:13:24.064
That should do it!

01:13:36.187 --> 01:13:38.246
Perhaps I overused my Sharingan.

01:13:44.796 --> 01:13:47.094
This is not the time to be lamenting.

01:13:54.806 --> 01:13:56.068
Wow!

01:14:02.313 --> 01:14:03.780
That poison mist again.

01:14:14.125 --> 01:14:15.786
Why...you!

01:14:33.478 --> 01:14:34.809
Papa!

01:14:37.649 --> 01:14:38.673
Hikaru!

01:14:39.183 --> 01:14:41.413
Papa! Papa!

01:14:53.831 --> 01:14:54.729
Brat...

01:15:00.672 --> 01:15:01.570
You!

01:15:01.906 --> 01:15:03.601
I won’t let you lay a ﬁnger on him!

01:15:04.142 --> 01:15:05.074
I wonder about that?

01:15:06.878 --> 01:15:08.140
— Let’s go!
— Let's go!

01:16:05.703 --> 01:16:07.432
Naruto...!

01:16:28.659 --> 01:16:30.320
It’s not over yet!

01:16:46.511 --> 01:16:48.001
The kid is next.

01:16:48.746 --> 01:16:51.943
Hey, hey... did I kill him?

01:17:14.739 --> 01:17:15.535
Impossible!

01:17:16.774 --> 01:17:19.038
Why? Why?!

01:17:20.678 --> 01:17:21.872
I made...

01:17:22.680 --> 01:17:23.977
I made...

01:17:25.783 --> 01:17:27.683
I made a promise...

01:17:28.386 --> 01:17:29.250
...to a friend!

01:17:30.054 --> 01:17:31.180
...to a friend!

01:17:31.489 --> 01:17:33.013
...to a friend!

01:17:33.424 --> 01:17:37.884
I’ll deﬁnitely protect my friend!

01:17:49.941 --> 01:17:50.930
Uh-oh...

01:17:51.442 --> 01:17:52.238
Oh?

01:17:53.444 --> 01:17:54.672
Oh!

01:17:55.246 --> 01:17:57.680
Fall! Fall down already!

01:17:57.782 --> 01:17:59.443
Papa! Papa!

01:18:24.275 --> 01:18:25.640
Hikaru...

01:18:43.561 --> 01:18:45.893
Farewell, Hikaru.

01:19:13.291 --> 01:19:14.883
Hikaru!

01:19:15.893 --> 01:19:17.485
Don’t give up hope!

01:19:29.073 --> 01:19:30.597
Trust me!

01:19:31.475 --> 01:19:32.339
Okay!

01:19:32.810 --> 01:19:36.109
Chamu, Chamu!
Please, lend me your strength!

01:19:36.380 --> 01:19:38.575
Take me...take me to Papa!

01:20:18.189 --> 01:20:19.281
Hikaru...?

01:20:25.963 --> 01:20:26.930
Papa!

01:20:49.453 --> 01:20:50.317
What?!

01:21:30.461 --> 01:21:32.326
You have to watch your step!

01:21:51.215 --> 01:21:52.182
Papa!

01:21:53.718 --> 01:21:56.551
Papa! Papa! Papa!

01:22:11.235 --> 01:22:12.725
I thought I was going to die!

01:22:13.270 --> 01:22:14.066
Papa!

01:22:20.678 --> 01:22:22.441
Thank you, Hikaru...!

01:22:38.662 --> 01:22:39.492
Chamu!

01:22:40.498 --> 01:22:41.362
Chamu!

01:22:42.199 --> 01:22:43.666
Chamu, Chamu!

01:22:52.443 --> 01:22:53.933
Thank you, Chamu!

01:22:54.545 --> 01:22:55.477
Thank you!

01:23:18.903 --> 01:23:20.564
W-Why you—!

01:23:22.173 --> 01:23:23.868
Shabadaba!

01:23:26.076 --> 01:23:27.543
How dare you...!

01:23:28.179 --> 01:23:30.409
So he’s the one
pulling the strings?!

01:23:33.484 --> 01:23:34.576
Huh?!

01:23:54.672 --> 01:23:55.604
Naruto...!

01:23:59.777 --> 01:24:02.644
Ishidate! Well done... !

01:24:11.422 --> 01:24:12.753
Rasengan!

01:24:21.198 --> 01:24:22.130
Naruto!

01:24:26.337 --> 01:24:28.498
You know what to do, don't you, Ishidate?

01:24:28.973 --> 01:24:31.373
Michiru! Kill Michiru!

01:24:33.777 --> 01:24:34.709
Naruto...!

01:24:39.683 --> 01:24:41.583
No, not the kid!

01:24:41.719 --> 01:24:43.710
Michiru! Mi-chi-ru!

01:24:45.122 --> 01:24:47.420
Hey, are you listening, Ishidate?!

01:24:47.858 --> 01:24:48.950
Not that one!

01:24:50.561 --> 01:24:55.089
Why you—! Have you forgotten
your debt to me?!

01:24:55.566 --> 01:24:59.502
You were exiled from your homeland
and became wanderers...

01:24:59.603 --> 01:25:03.334
Who was it that hired you?!

01:25:04.675 --> 01:25:05.801
Ishidate!

01:25:06.377 --> 01:25:07.503
Hey, you!

01:25:07.845 --> 01:25:09.574
Why you ingrate!

01:25:14.485 --> 01:25:15.383
Papa!

01:25:17.488 --> 01:25:18.887
Mister?

01:25:19.556 --> 01:25:22.252
Listen to my order, Ishidate!

01:25:22.359 --> 01:25:24.327
Shut up!

01:25:51.822 --> 01:25:52.789
Papa?!

01:25:55.159 --> 01:25:56.820
Oww!

01:25:57.027 --> 01:25:57.823
Papa!

01:26:01.565 --> 01:26:04.659
Let’s end this!

01:26:09.974 --> 01:26:10.906
Papa!

01:26:11.475 --> 01:26:12.237
Mister!

01:26:14.812 --> 01:26:16.575
Papa! Papa!

01:26:27.858 --> 01:26:29.450
Chamu! Kikki!

01:26:30.761 --> 01:26:31.523
Papa!

01:26:32.096 --> 01:26:33.222
Don’t run away, Papa!

01:26:34.064 --> 01:26:41.232
Naruto, Chamu and Kikki
are all ﬁghting for us, for our country!

01:26:42.406 --> 01:26:44.203
So we... you and I...

01:26:46.777 --> 01:26:49.439
must not give up!

01:27:42.466 --> 01:27:44.866
I did it, Guy Sensei!

01:27:45.569 --> 01:27:48.595
I kept it...
my precious promise!

01:28:03.187 --> 01:28:05.155
Are you all right, Sensei?

01:28:06.090 --> 01:28:09.355
No, no... I think I’ll be out of action
for two weeks.

01:28:09.593 --> 01:28:14.292
Yes! Then until you’ve recovered,
we’re on vacation mode!

01:28:19.403 --> 01:28:21.769
Naruto, thank you.

01:28:23.107 --> 01:28:25.268
l was such a fool.

01:28:26.043 --> 01:28:28.412
l was ignorant and didn’t know

01:28:28.412 --> 01:28:32.644
the great things my father
was trying to do.

01:28:33.951 --> 01:28:36.249
What it means to be king.

01:28:37.087 --> 01:28:40.022
What it means to govern a country.

01:28:40.791 --> 01:28:44.828
I still don’t quite understand
and I’m not sure what kind of job I’ll do,

01:28:44.828 --> 01:28:46.819
but I’m going to do my very best.

01:28:47.898 --> 01:28:50.025
Like my father before me.

01:28:51.802 --> 01:28:55.260
Right! I’m sure you can do it, Mister.

01:28:58.242 --> 01:28:59.209
Thank you!

01:29:00.978 --> 01:29:02.138
I’ll help, too!

01:29:02.513 --> 01:29:04.208
I’m counting on you, Hikaru!

01:29:04.648 --> 01:29:05.307
Uh-huh!

01:29:19.163 --> 01:29:22.462
I’ll never forget
what happened today.

01:29:26.270 --> 01:29:28.033
I’ll never, ever forget...

01:29:28.972 --> 01:29:31.770
what everyone did for us.

01:29:33.143 --> 01:29:35.976
How everyone did their best for us.

01:29:37.047 --> 01:29:40.107
How we all joined forces to protect
what is precious to us.

01:29:44.488 --> 01:29:45.546
I won’t forget.

01:29:46.590 --> 01:29:50.151
My precious friends.

01:30:14.618 --> 01:30:15.778
I won’t forget.

01:30:16.687 --> 01:30:18.086
I won’t forget.

01:30:22.859 --> 01:30:25.919
I won’t forget what’s precious to us.

01:30:52.222 --> 01:31:02.427
Is the flower blossomed
beyond this continuing road?

